   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KWN - Core support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the Kvinnna till Kvinna Foundation&apos;s regional programme &quot;Democracy and Resilience in the Western Balkans: Supporting Feminist Change Agents&quot; the partner organisation Kosovo Women&apos;s Network (KWN) is recieving core support. This core support will strengthen the organisational capacitites of KWN and contribute to both of the impact areas of the programme; anti-democracy movements and narratives challenged across the Western Balkans, and Improved alignment across the Western Balkans with Istanbul Convention within focus countries, e.g. re. victim/survivor centered approach, coordinated multisectoral service provision, access to justice.</narrative>
  </description>
